### Hot Reload vs. Hot Restart

**Hot Reload:** Applies supported code changes to a running Flutter application without restarting the application from the beginning. It usually preserves the current application state.

**Hot Restart:** Restarts the Dart application and resets its state, while avoiding a complete rebuild of the development environment.

